<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?><rdf:RDF xmlns:cc="http://creativecommons.org/ns#" xmlns:dct="http://purl.org/dc/terms/" xmlns:adms="http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#" xmlns:foaf="http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/" xmlns:odrl="http://www.w3.org/ns/odrl/2/" xmlns:owl="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#" xmlns:dcat="http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#" xmlns:lcon="http://www.w3.org/ns/locn#" xmlns:sioc="http://rdfs.org/sioc/ns#" xmlns:rdf="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#" xmlns:rdfs="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" xmlns:prov="http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#" xmlns:skos="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xmlns:schema="http://schema.org/" xmlns:v="http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#" xmlns:vann="http://purl.org/vocab/vann/" xmlns:voaf="http://purl.org/vocommons/voaf#" xmlns:wdrs="http://www.w3.org/2007/05/powder-s#" xmlns:xsd="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#" xmlns:spdx="http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#" xmlns:time="http://www.w3.org/2006/time#" xmlns:dcatap="http://data.europa.eu/r5r/" xmlns:stat="http://data.europa.eu/s1n/statdcat-ap/" xmlns:qb="http://purl.org/linked-data/cube#" ><dcat:Dataset rdf:about="http://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/web/products-datasets/-/tipsii44"><dct:issued rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2015-04-20</dct:issued><dcat:keyword  xml:lang="de">Zahlungsbilanz Position</dcat:keyword><dcat:keyword  xml:lang="en">Balance of payments item</dcat:keyword><dcat:keyword  xml:lang="fr">Poste de la balance des paiements</dcat:keyword><dcat:keyword  xml:lang="de">Währung</dcat:keyword><dcat:keyword  xml:lang="en">Currency</dcat:keyword><dcat:keyword  xml:lang="fr">Monnaie</dcat:keyword><dcat:keyword  xml:lang="de">Zeitliche Frequenz</dcat:keyword><dcat:keyword  xml:lang="en">Time frequency</dcat:keyword><dcat:keyword  xml:lang="fr">Fréquence (relative au temps)</dcat:keyword><dcat:keyword  xml:lang="de">Geopolitische Meldeeinheit</dcat:keyword><dcat:keyword  xml:lang="en">Geopolitical entity (reporting)</dcat:keyword><dcat:keyword  xml:lang="fr">Entité géopolitique (déclarante)</dcat:keyword><dcat:keyword  xml:lang="de">Geopolitische Partnereinheit</dcat:keyword><dcat:keyword  xml:lang="en">Geopolitical entity (partner)</dcat:keyword><dcat:keyword  xml:lang="fr">Entité géopolitique (partenaire)</dcat:keyword><dcat:keyword  xml:lang="de">Sektor (ESVG 2010)</dcat:keyword><dcat:keyword  xml:lang="en">Sector (ESA 2010)</dcat:keyword><dcat:keyword  xml:lang="fr">Secteur (SEC 2010)</dcat:keyword><dcat:keyword  xml:lang="de">Sektor des Transaktionspartners (ESVG 2010)</dcat:keyword><dcat:keyword  xml:lang="en">Counterpart sector (ESA 2010)</dcat:keyword><dcat:keyword  xml:lang="fr">Secteur de contrepartie (SEC 2010)</dcat:keyword><dcat:keyword  xml:lang="de">Bestand oder Fluss</dcat:keyword><dcat:keyword  xml:lang="en">Stock or flow</dcat:keyword><dcat:keyword  xml:lang="fr">Stock ou flux</dcat:keyword><dct:type><skos:Concept  rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/dataset-type/STATISTICAL"/></dct:type><dct:title xml:lang="en">Financial derivatives and employee stock options - quarterly data, million units of national currency</dct:title><dct:description xml:lang="en">The international investment position (IIP) is a statistical statement that shows at a point in time the value and composition of: -financial assets of residents of an economy that are claims on non-residents and gold bullion held as reserve assets, and -liabilities of residents of an economy to non-residents. The difference between an economy’s external financial assets and liabilities is the economy’s net IIP, which may be positive or negative. According to the functional category, the cross-border financial positions are classified as: 1) For the assets - Direct investment; Portfolio investment; Financial derivatives and employee stock options ; Other investment and Reserve assets 2) For the liabilities - Direct investment; Portfolio investment; Financial derivatives and employee stock options and Other investment The financial positions are further classified according to the different instruments. The data on portfolio investment are expressed in million units of national currency. The indicator is based on the Eurostat data from the Balance of payment statistics, these data are quaterly reported to the ECB by the EU Member States. Definitions are based on the IMF Sixth Balance of Payments Manual (BPM6).</dct:description><dct:title xml:lang="fr">Produits financiers dérivés et options sur titres des salariés - données trimestrielles, millions d&apos;unités monétaires nationales</dct:title><dct:description xml:lang="fr">La position extérieure globale (PEG) est un état statistique qui donne la valeur et la composition à un moment déterminé: - des actifs financiers des résidents d’une économie qui sont des créances sur les non-résidents ou sont détenus sous forme d’or physique à titre d’avoirs de réserve, et - des passifs des résidents d’une économie à l&apos;égard des non-résidents. La différence entre les actifs et les passifs financiers étrangers d&apos;une économie constitue la PEG nette d&apos;une économie, qui peut être positive ou négative. Les catégories fonctionnelles distinguent plusieurs types de positions transfrontalières: 1) pour les actifs - investissements directs, investissements de portefeuille, Produits financiers dérivés et options sur titres des salariés, autres investissements et avoirs de réserve; 2) pour les passifs - investissements directs, investissements de portefeuille, Produits financiers dérivés et options sur titres des salariés et autres investissements. Les positions financières sont également classées par type d&apos;instrument. Les données relatives aux Portfolio investements sont exprimées en millions d&apos;unités monétaires nationales. L&apos;indicateur est établi sur la base des données d&apos;eurostat issues des statistiques de la balance des paiements. Ces données sont transmises chaque trimestre par les États membres de l&apos;UE. Les définitions sont fondées sur le 6e manuel de la balance des paiements (MBP6).</dct:description><dct:title xml:lang="de">Finanzderivate und Mitarbeiteraktienoptionen - vierteljährliche Daten, Millionen Landeswährung</dct:title><dct:description xml:lang="de">Der Auslandsvermögensstatus (AVS) ist eine statistische Angabe über den Wert und die Zusammensetzung folgender Positionen zu einem bestimmten Zeitpunkt: - Finanzielle Vermögenswerte Gebietsansässiger eines Wirtschaftsgebiets, die Forderungen gegenüber Gebietsfremden darstellen, und als Währungsreserve gehaltenes Barrengold, sowie - Verbindlichkeiten Gebietsansässiger eines Wirtschaftsgebiets gegenüber Gebietsfremden. Der Unterschied zwischen den finanziellen Forderungen und Verbindlichkeiten einer Volkswirtschaft gegenüber dem Ausland ist der Nettoauslandsvermögensstatus, der positiv oder negativ ausfallen kann. Je nach funktionaler Kategorie werden die grenzüberschreitenden finanziellen Positionen wie folgt eingestuft: 1) für die Forderungen – Direktinvestitionen; Wertpapieranlagen; Finanzderivate und Mitarbeiteraktienoptionen; Übriger Kapitalverkehr und Währungsreserven; 2) für die Verbindlichkeiten – Direktinvestitionen; Wertpapieranlagen; Finanzderivate und Mitarbeiteraktienoptionen und Übriger Kapitalverkehr. Diese finanziellen Positionen werden außerdem nach den verschiedenen Instrumenten eingestuft. Die Daten zu Wertpapieranlagen werden in Mio. Landeswährung ausgedrückt. Der Indikator basiert auf den Daten von Eurostat aus der Zahlungsbilanzstatistik. Diese Daten werden von den Mitgliedstaaten der EU vierteljährlich gemeldet. Die Definitionen beruhen auf der sechsten Auflage des IWF-Handbuchs zur Zahlungsbilanzstatistik (BPM6).</dct:description><dct:identifier>tipsii44</dct:identifier><foaf:page rdf:resource="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/databrowser/product/page/tipsii44"/><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/BEL"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/BGR"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/CZE"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/DNK"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/DEU"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/EST"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/IRL"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/GRC"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/ESP"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/FRA"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/HRV"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/ITA"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/CYP"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/LVA"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/LTU"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/LUX"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/HUN"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/MLT"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/NLD"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/AUT"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/POL"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/PRT"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/ROU"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/SVN"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/SVK"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/FIN"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/SWE"/></dct:spatial><stat:dimension> <qb:DimensionProperty rdf:about="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/api/dissemination/sdmx/2.1/codelist/ESTAT/BOP_ITEM" > <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="de">Zahlungsbilanz Position</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Balance of payments item</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="fr">Poste de la balance des paiements</skos:prefLabel> </qb:DimensionProperty> </stat:dimension><stat:dimension> <qb:DimensionProperty rdf:about="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/api/dissemination/sdmx/2.1/codelist/ESTAT/CURRENCY" > <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="de">Währung</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Currency</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="fr">Monnaie</skos:prefLabel> </qb:DimensionProperty> </stat:dimension><stat:dimension> <qb:DimensionProperty rdf:about="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/api/dissemination/sdmx/2.1/codelist/ESTAT/FREQ" > <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="de">Zeitliche Frequenz</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Time frequency</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="fr">Fréquence (relative au temps)</skos:prefLabel> </qb:DimensionProperty> </stat:dimension><stat:dimension> <qb:DimensionProperty rdf:about="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/api/dissemination/sdmx/2.1/codelist/ESTAT/GEO" > <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="de">Geopolitische Meldeeinheit</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Geopolitical entity (reporting)</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="fr">Entité géopolitique (déclarante)</skos:prefLabel> </qb:DimensionProperty> </stat:dimension><stat:dimension> <qb:DimensionProperty rdf:about="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/api/dissemination/sdmx/2.1/codelist/ESTAT/PARTNER" > <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="de">Geopolitische Partnereinheit</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Geopolitical entity (partner)</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="fr">Entité géopolitique (partenaire)</skos:prefLabel> </qb:DimensionProperty> </stat:dimension><stat:dimension> <qb:DimensionProperty rdf:about="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/api/dissemination/sdmx/2.1/codelist/ESTAT/SECTOR10" > <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="de">Sektor (ESVG 2010)</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Sector (ESA 2010)</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="fr">Secteur (SEC 2010)</skos:prefLabel> </qb:DimensionProperty> </stat:dimension><stat:dimension> <qb:DimensionProperty rdf:about="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/api/dissemination/sdmx/2.1/codelist/ESTAT/SECTPART" > <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="de">Sektor des Transaktionspartners (ESVG 2010)</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Counterpart sector (ESA 2010)</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="fr">Secteur de contrepartie (SEC 2010)</skos:prefLabel> </qb:DimensionProperty> </stat:dimension><stat:dimension> <qb:DimensionProperty rdf:about="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/api/dissemination/sdmx/2.1/codelist/ESTAT/STK_FLOW" > <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="de">Bestand oder Fluss</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Stock or flow</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="fr">Stock ou flux</skos:prefLabel> </qb:DimensionProperty> </stat:dimension><stat:attribute> <qb:AttributeProperty rdf:about="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/api/dissemination/sdmx/2.1/codelist/ESTAT/OBS_FLAG" /> </stat:attribute><stat:attribute> <qb:AttributeProperty rdf:about="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/api/dissemination/sdmx/2.1/codelist/ESTAT/CONF_STATUS" /> </stat:attribute><stat:statUnitMeasure><skos:Concept rdf:about="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/api/dissemination/sdmx/2.1/codelist/ESTAT/CURRENCY?code=MIO_NAC"><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="de">Millionen Einheiten der Landeswährung</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Million units of national currency</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="fr">Millions d&apos;unités de monnaie nationale</skos:prefLabel></skos:Concept></stat:statUnitMeasure><stat:numSeries rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">81</stat:numSeries><dct:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2025-04-11</dct:modified><dct:accrualPeriodicity><dct:Frequency rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/frequency/QUARTERLY"/></dct:accrualPeriodicity><dct:temporal><dct:PeriodOfTime rdf:about="http://purl.org/dc/terms/PeriodOfTime/3169a64b-f3b3-4920-b709-b32c20b97678"><dcat:startDate rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">1995-01-01</dcat:startDate><dcat:endDate rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2024-12-31</dcat:endDate></dct:PeriodOfTime></dct:temporal><dct:accessRights><dct:RightsStatement rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/access-right/PUBLIC"/></dct:accessRights><dcat:landingPage><foaf:Document rdf:about="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/databrowser/product/page/tipsii44"><dct:type rdf:resource="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/documentation-type/WEBPAGE_RELATED"/><schema:url xml:lang="en">https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/databrowser/product/page/tipsii44</schema:url><dct:title xml:lang="en">More information on Eurostat Website</dct:title><dct:title xml:lang="fr">Plus d&apos;information sur le site web d&apos;Eurostat</dct:title><dct:title xml:lang="de">Mehr Informationen auf der Eurostat Website</dct:title></foaf:Document></dcat:landingPage><foaf:page><foaf:Document rdf:about="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/cache/metadata/en/tipsii_esms.htm"><dct:title xml:lang="en">ESMS metadata (Euro-SDMX Metadata structure) HTML</dct:title><foaf:topic rdf:resource="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/databrowser/product/page/tipsii44"/><schema:url xml:lang="en"><![CDATA[https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/cache/metadata/en/tipsii_esms.htm]]></schema:url><dct:format rdf:resource="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/file-type/HTML"/><dcat:mediaType rdf:resource="http://www.iana.org/assignments/media-types/text/html"/><dct:type><skos:Concept rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/documentation-type/DOCUMENTATION_MAIN"/></dct:type></foaf:Document></foaf:page><foaf:page><foaf:Document rdf:about="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/api/dissemination/files?file=metadata/tipsii_esms.sdmx.zip"><dct:title xml:lang="en">ESMS metadata (Euro-SDMX Metadata structure) SDMX</dct:title><foaf:topic rdf:resource="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/databrowser/product/page/tipsii44"/><schema:url xml:lang="en"><![CDATA[https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/api/dissemination/files?file=metadata/tipsii_esms.sdmx.zip]]></schema:url><dct:format rdf:resource="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/file-type/XML"/><dcat:mediaType rdf:resource="http://www.iana.org/assignments/media-types/application/xml"/><dct:type><skos:Concept rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/documentation-type/DOCUMENTATION_MAIN"/></dct:type></foaf:Document></foaf:page><dcat:distribution><dcat:Distribution rdf:about="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/databrowser/view/tipsii44/default/table"><dct:title xml:lang="en">Table, graphs and map visualizations are also available.</dct:title><dct:title xml:lang="fr">Des visualisations sous forme de tableau, graphique et carte géographique sont aussi disponibles.</dct:title><dct:title xml:lang="de">Tabellen, Grafiken und geografische Darstellungen sind ebenfalls verfügbar.</dct:title><dcat:accessURL rdf:resource="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/databrowser/view/tipsii44/default/table"/><dct:type rdf:resource="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/distribution-type/VISUALIZATION"/><dct:license rdf:resource="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/licence/CC_BY_4_0"/><dct:rights rdf:resource="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/access-right/PUBLIC"/><dct:format rdf:resource="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/file-type/HTML"/><dcat:mediaType rdf:resource="http://www.iana.org/assignments/media-types/text/html"/></dcat:Distribution></dcat:distribution><dcat:distribution><dcat:Distribution rdf:about="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/api/dissemination/sdmx/2.1/data/tipsii44?format=tsv&amp;compressed=true"><dct:title xml:lang="en">Download dataset in TSV format</dct:title><dct:type rdf:resource="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/distribution-type/DOWNLOADABLE_FILE"/><dcat:accessURL rdf:resource="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/api/dissemination/sdmx/2.1/data/tipsii44?format=tsv&amp;compressed=true"/><dcat:downloadURL rdf:resource="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/api/dissemination/sdmx/2.1/data/tipsii44?format=tsv&amp;compressed=true"/><dct:compressformat><dct:MediaTypeOrExtent rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/file-type/GZIP"/></dct:compressformat><dct:format><dct:MediaTypeOrExtent rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/file-type/TSV"/></dct:format><dcat:mediaType rdf:resource="http://www.iana.org/assignments/media-types/text/tab-separated-values"/><dct:license><dct:LicenseDocument rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/licence/CC_BY_4_0"/></dct:license><dct:rights rdf:resource="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/access-right/PUBLIC"/><dcat:byteSize>22718</dcat: